# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and machine-local material. Nothing here may ever be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The client signing private key. Registered on a specific device under
# physical presence; generate your own (see docs/REPRODUCING.md).
client_key.pem
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated Matter data model.
#
# `zap/generated/zap-generated/` is ~16 MB of Matter SDK output, almost all of
# it standard clusters that have nothing to do with this component. It is a
# derived artifact of a pinned SDK commit and would rot against any bump.
# Regenerate it with the three commands in docs/REPRODUCING.md; the inputs that
# determine it — VendorTunnelCluster.xml, add_tunnel_cluster.py, the .zap and
# the .matter IDL — are all tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
zap/generated/zap-generated/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build products
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
*-build.log
*.hex
*.elf
*.map
rcp-dongle.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments and editor/OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
measure/venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
